#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:191
msgid ""
"%d of %d observed responses were not used. That is normal: the observer sees "
"every answer on the network, and only the ones for a domain you routed are "
"of any interest."
msgstr "%d 个响应未被使用（共观察到 %d 个）。这是正常的：观察者会看到网络上的每个应答，只有那些被你路由的域名的应答才有意义。"

