msgstr "学习到的地址（%d）"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:401
msgid ""
"Log every observed DNS answer and every set write. Useful for a bug report, "
"noisy in normal operation - on a router running adblock roughly half of all "
"answers are error replies, and each one gets a line."
msgstr "记录每个观察到的 DNS 应答和每个集合写入。对提交错误报告有用，正常运行时会很嘈杂——在运行 adblock 的路由器上，大约一半的应答都是错误回复，每个都会占一行。"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:404
msgid "Manage rp_filter"
msgstr "管理 rp_filter"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:205
msgid "Mark"
msgstr "标记"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:129
msgid "Message ends mid-structure"
msgstr "消息在结构中间结束"

#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:130
msgid "Message too long"
msgstr "消息过长"

